{* a mail to a participant of a private message thread about a new message (English); rendered once per language *}
<p>There is a new message from <strong>{$message->user->username}</strong> in the private conversation <strong>{$message->thread->subject}</strong>.</p>
<p><a href={$url}>Show the message</a></p>
<p style="color: #666; font-size: small">You will get the next notification about this conversation after you open it again. Turn the notifications off in the conversation with the button “Do not notify me by mail”.</p>
